    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929110/extras/6e57f982466e1953e316fc67f21920e4.avif?t=1713625740\" width=600 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play a part in the efforts to save your world as a new turn of event unfold. In this Action/Adventure game a hero instinct will guide you through this journey facing a set of challenges, from rescuing survivors to taking action to destroy each and all of the hostile invaders.</h2><br><strong>It was not a coincidence that you were saved.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3rd person platformer <br></li><li>Pilot a ship to space and inside the invader ships<br></li><li>Various puzzles and missions to accomplish<br></li><li>Time slowing mechanics</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929110/extras/662c1fb9bc5cbe337cc9f13f782929ee.avif?t=1713625740\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929110/extras/b9c691ebf9c46cc53c97c9861d5f8838.avif?t=1713625740\" width=600 height=300 /></span>",
